{"id":2050,"name":"燕麦鸡蛋饼","image":"/images/dishes/htc-2050.jpg","category":"早餐","taste":"咸鲜","cookingMethod":"早餐制作","difficulty":"简单","cookingTime":"15分钟","servings":"","ingredients":["快熟燕麦片","鸡蛋","牛奶","食用油或黄油","菠菜（可选）","盐（可选）","白胡椒粉（可选）"],"preparation":["快熟燕麦片 50g","鸡蛋 2个","牛奶 80ml","食用油或黄油 5ml","菠菜 50g（可选）","盐 1g（可选）","白胡椒粉 0.5g（可选）"],"steps":["燕麦片与牛奶混合，静置 5 分钟使燕麦吸水变软。","鸡蛋充分打散；使用菠菜时，将菠菜洗净、焯水 30 秒并挤干后切碎。","蛋液、泡软的燕麦和可选菠菜混合，加入盐和白胡椒粉搅匀。","不粘平底锅刷油，中小火倒入面糊并摊成厚度均匀的圆饼。","加盖煎 3-4 分钟，待底部定型、表面基本凝固后翻面。","另一面继续煎 2-3 分钟，确认中心蛋液完全凝固后出锅。"],"nutrition":{"calories":"535 大卡"},"videoTutorials":{"platforms":[{"key":"bilibili","name":"哔哩哔哩","searchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=%E7%87%95%E9%BA%A6%E9%B8%A1%E8%9B%8B%E9%A5%BC%20%E5%AE%B6%E5%B8%B8%E5%81%9A%E6%B3%95%20%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B"},{"key":"douyin","name":"抖音","searchUrl":"https://www.douyin.com/search/%E7%87%95%E9%BA%A6%E9%B8%A1%E8%9B%8B%E9%A5%BC%20%E5%AE%B6%E5%B8%B8%E5%81%9A%E6%B3%95%20%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B?type=video"}]},"source":{"name":"HowToCook","repository":"Anduin2017/HowToCook","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/c694a5c457d45e6e012ae6cd9a7724aab86e320b/dishes/breakfast/%E7%87%95%E9%BA%A6%E9%B8%A1%E8%9B%8B%E9%A5%BC.md","imageSource":{"author":"Drhnn","license":"CC BY 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Oatmeal%20pancake%20with%20fruit.jpg"}}}
